        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"You are helping a nuclear physicist run the EXCLURAD radiative-corrections code. Request: Eta with Q2 = -0.5 GeV2 at W = 1.7, cos theta* = 0, phi* = 90.\n\nWhen you are done, write an `outcome.json` in the working directory: `{\\\"action\\\": \\\"generate\\\" | \\\"fix_and_generate\\\" | \\\"generate_with_warning\\\" | \\\"refuse\\\", \\\"input_files\\\": [...], \\\"flags\\\": [...], \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"...\\\"}`. Write any EXCLURAD input files you produce next to it. If the request is physically impossible, refuse and say why. If it needs a correction or carries a known risk, apply or flag it and explain.\"",
          "id": "prt_088a1b944001SenREBDtANQr5e",
          "sessionID": "ses_f775e46d3ffex94cYSJor724eI",
          "messageID": "msg_088a1b941001QK3df6wR621a5W"
